# Persona AI Architecture

Persona AI is NOT a banking dashboard.

Persona AI is an Adaptive Banking Security Platform.

Every new feature must integrate into one or more of the following core intelligence layers:

1. Behavioral AI
2. Context Intelligence
3. Fraud Intelligence Network (FIN)
4. Government Intelligence (FRI/MNRL)
5. Explainable AI
6. Adaptive Authentication

Do not implement isolated demo features.

Every new feature should strengthen the overall platform architecture rather than exist independently.

When designing new functionality, prioritize platform cohesion over feature quantity.
